fluxecho.skin.hull.tip=§3Pearl-white composite panels: the city's bones and crowns§r\nEvery building is built round them, with a nexus-cyan keel pointing home
fluxecho.skin.footing.tip=§3Warm black basalt, dressed and coursed: the stone under every building§r\nThere are never lamp windows in it
fluxecho.skin.moss.tip=§3Bronze gone green, the raised parts rubbed bright: a skin of the garden§r
fluxecho.skin.marble.tip=§3Warm white stone with gilt bands: a skin of the garden§r
fluxecho.skin.ink.tip=§3Ink-black slate with fine upright brushing: a skin of the scriptorium§r
fluxecho.skin.paper.tip=§3Warm white paper fibre; a lantern panel glows warm from behind: a skin of the scriptorium§r
